  "note": "both attestation bodies are ordinary COSE_Sign1 payloads; VerifyEgressAttestation takes NO serving-party/connection identity, so the same bytes verify identically whether the gateway or a third party serves them. The cross-language SIGNED-object digest pin (Go and Rust ML-DSA-65 over the content_free body, all-0x11 32-byte seed) is computed once from a Go/Rust run and hardcoded in both impls' tests, exactly as gateway_test.go's crossLangPinnedSignedDecisionSHA384 - Python stdlib has no ML-DSA so this oracle cannot compute it independently."
